Every data path for the 10.5.0.x and 10.6.0.x groups is fully functional. The trunk between switch4 and sshswitch carries VLAN 1 (native), VLAN 5, and VLAN 6 — both subinterfaces are UP and correctly bridged on both sides. No mechanism or historical trace for the claimed fault is visible in the current lab state.

